{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1491548-the-grand-inquisitor-and-the-purge-of-the-cathari","id":1491548,"title":"The Grand Inquisitor and the purge of the Cathari","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-27T20:24:29-07:00","id":1491548,"title":"The Grand Inquisitor and the purge of the Cathari","content":"I've been running a campaign in which the events that weakened the Sabbat have been greatly toned down, but still happened to a degree. I.e. The Sabbat did lose a substantial amount of territory, did have some Lasombra defect, and did have some Sabbat head to the Middle East, but not nearly to the catastrophic degree as canon.<br /> <br /> In my game, the main culprit for this has been the Cathari Demagogues. Their message of hedonism has been very appealing to younger Sabbat, and has caused that Path to swell in number to the point of outnumbering any other three Paths. The hedonistic leadership of the Cathari Demagogues has been a disaster, costing the Sabbat a large amount of territory.<br /> <br /> The other Paths have gotten sick of their incompetence and hedonism, and this has, as of tonight's game session, lead to Civil War. The Cathari have been declared a heretical Path, the role of Regent has been abolished, the Grand Inquisitor has become the leader of the Sabbat, and efforts are underway to purge the Cathari from the sect completely.<br /> <br /> My players participated in this purge, tricking a large number of Cathari into storming a building that supposedly contained the Camarilla Prince, but which was actually rigged with gasoline, trapping them in there, and then burning them alive. They also helped assassinate the Cathari Archbishop of New Orleans.<br /> <br /> New Orleans is now the capital of a cleansed, strong Sabbat, a Sabbat lead, as it always should have been, by the Sabbat Inquisition.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-27T20:28:49-07:00","id":1491549,"title":"","content":"Sounds like an awesome plot.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-28T18:52:48-07:00","id":1491699,"title":"","content":"I like New Orleans as their stronghold. And the \u201cCathars\u201d probably *should* be considered heretical. On the other hand, purging the largest path from the sect is a tall order, and in the Sabbat it\u2019s usually the howling lunatics that end up winning. Tell them we\u2019re praying for them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/352-black-flag","name":"Black Flag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar352_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-28T19:42:42-07:00","id":1491703,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Flag</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1491548-the-grand-inquisitor-and-the-purge-of-the-cathari?p=1491699#post1491699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like New Orleans as their stronghold. And the \u201cCathars\u201d probably *should* be considered heretical. On the other hand, purging the largest path from the sect is a tall order, and in the Sabbat it\u2019s usually the howling lunatics that end up winning. Tell them we\u2019re praying for them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Right now who the Noddists support will likely be the deciding factor. Noddists are very focused on external enemies, especially the Antedeluvians and those they perceive as Antedeluvian servants. They tend to reflexively oppose any changes to the Sabbat's status quo, as internal battles weaken the Sabbat's ability to present a unified front against the Antedeluvians. So many don't look kindly on the Grand Inquisitor grabbing power and abolishing the Regent position.They tend to reflexively see the hands of the Antedeluvians in such radical change.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, many share the view that the Cathari have become a bloated mass of shovelhead trash whose sheer numbers have given them political power vastly eclipsing their military competence. So they could go either way.<br /> <br /> So basically, my next writing challenge will be finding a way to make the players a crucial player in who the Noddists ultimately side with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3598,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","user":"CajunKhan","date":". 08-28-2022, 11:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-31T08:08:41-07:00","id":1492009,"title":"","content":"It's a nice parallel to the inquisatory purge of the Cathars.<br /> <br /> I'm not well read on V5 canon, who gets New Orleans there? V20 made it sound like Hecata, which it kinda was before there were Hecata.<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> I hope you gave your player <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caedite_eos._Novit_enim_Dominus_qui_sunt_eius.\" target=\"_blank\">the quote</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Custom Sorcery: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1487084-pattern-weaving-ananasi-sorcery-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">For Ananasi</a> | Mortal:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1509365-hekau-for-sorcerers\" target=\"_blank\"> Hekau</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1550552-ma%C5%A1ma%C5%A1%C5%A1%C5%ABtu-mesopotamian-sorcery\" target=\"_blank\">Ma\u0161ma\u0161\u0161\u016btu</a> | Necromancy:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1514352\" target=\"_blank\"> Dust Path</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1535508-dav20-older-lamia-lore?p=1536244#post1536244\" target=\"_blank\">P.o.Fertile Grave Soil</a> | Thauma: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1515316\" target=\"_blank\">Ars Notoria</a>","edited":{"userid":27477,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27477-voidshaper","user":"voidshaper","date":". 08-31-2022, 12:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27477-voidshaper","name":"voidshaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-31T10:42:21-07:00","id":1492019,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>voidshaper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1491548-the-grand-inquisitor-and-the-purge-of-the-cathari?p=1492009#post1492009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a nice parallel to the inquisatory purge of the Cathars.<br /> <br /> I'm not well read on V5 canon, who gets New Orleans there? V20 made it sound like Hecata, which it kinda was before there were Hecata.<br /> <br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think they have a canon for New Orleans yet. Not that I care. I greatly prefer a blend of V20 and my own homebrew for which sect has what territory. I do greatly prefer V5 dice mechanics, however. I use V5 dice mechanics, &quot;Long Hard Road Out Of Hell&quot;, and my own homebrew for V5 Sabbat character construction.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>voidshaper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1491548-the-grand-inquisitor-and-the-purge-of-the-cathari?p=1492009#post1492009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I hope you gave your player <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caedite_eos._Novit_enim_Dominus_qui_sunt_eius.\" target=\"_blank\">the quote</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div>I haven't, but I will now. Thank you for the idea! :-D","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3598,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","user":"CajunKhan","date":". 08-31-2022, 04:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-31T11:16:01-07:00","id":1492020,"title":"","content":"I love the parallels between the purge of the cathars. A minor suggestion-have the position of Regent temporarily suspended as a state of emergency rather than disbanded as a plot hook for further internal politics","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-31T13:29:42-07:00","id":1492027,"title":"","content":"The crimes of the Cathari:<br /> (1)Raising their shovelheads to True Sabbat status in far too short a period of time. The Cathari have been swelling their numbers by granting their shovelheads True Sabbat status as soon as they display devotion to the Cathari path, sometimes in as little as a month. Other paths only grant their shovelheads True Sabbat status after years of displaying military competence and discipline. This has resulted in the weakening of the Sabbat, by flooding it with incompetent morons whose only skill is using hedonism to avoid becoming wights.<br /> <br /> (2)Failure to hide Sabbat secrets. The Sabbat does not believe in the masquerade in the sense of hiding your monstrousness from yourself. You are a predator, accept it and find a Path that gives you inner peace with this reality. The Sabbat does, however, recognize the need of predators to operate with stealth. The Cathari have consistently failed to operate with stealth, resulting in a large number of lethal stampedes from heavily armed juicebags.<br /> <br /> (3)The Cathari have abandoned Sabbat territory, justifying their cowardice with absurd propaganda about the Sabbat &quot;not needing our own domain&quot; because we are somehow &quot;more dangerous without a domain&quot;. This makes them idiots, cowards, traitors, and liars. Their actions have cost the Sabbat the safe territory needed to hunt, to build up military resources, and to advance on the spiritual journeys our Paths require unmolested by those who would kill all of us who refuse to cling to &quot;humanity&quot;.<br /> <br /> For the these crimes against the Sabbat, the Cathari are declared heretical, and unworthy of the blood of Caine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3598,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","user":"CajunKhan","date":". 08-31-2022, 07:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-02T10:21:18-07:00","id":1492171,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1491548-the-grand-inquisitor-and-the-purge-of-the-cathari?p=1492027#post1492027\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The crimes of the Cathari:<br /> (1)Raising their shovelheads to True Sabbat status in far too short a period of time. The Cathari have been swelling their numbers by granting their shovelheads True Sabbat status as soon as they display devotion to the Cathari path, sometimes in as little as a month. Other paths only grant their shovelheads True Sabbat status after years of displaying military competence and discipline. This has resulted in the weakening of the Sabbat, by flooding it with incompetent morons whose only skill is using hedonism to avoid becoming wights.<br /> <br /> (2)Failure to hide Sabbat secrets. The Sabbat does not believe in the masquerade in the sense of hiding your monstrousness from yourself. You are a predator, accept it and find a Path that gives you inner peace with this reality. The Sabbat does, however, recognize the need of predators to operate with stealth. The Cathari have consistently failed to operate with stealth, resulting in a large number of lethal stampedes from heavily armed juicebags.<br /> <br /> (3)The Cathari have abandoned Sabbat territory, justifying their cowardice with absurd propaganda about the Sabbat &quot;not needing our own domain&quot; because we are somehow &quot;more dangerous without a domain&quot;. This makes them idiots, cowards, traitors, and liars. Their actions have cost the Sabbat the safe territory needed to hunt, to build up military resources, and to advance on the spiritual journeys our Paths require unmolested by those who would kill all of us who refuse to cling to &quot;humanity&quot;.<br /> <br /> For the these crimes against the Sabbat, the Cathari are declared heretical, and unworthy of the blood of Caine.</div> </div> </div> </div>Additional suggested crimes.<br /> <br /> -embracing human hedonism and rejection of vampiric excellence to wallow in degeneracy.<br /> <br /> -corrupting neonates<br /> <br /> -betrayal of the paths of feral heart and honerable accord<br /> <br /> -rejecting the Caledonian faith of the Sabbat and practising the heathen gnostic religion.<br /> <br /> -demon worship in their servitude to the demiurge","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 09-02-2022, 01:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-04T13:19:28-07:00","id":1492312,"title":"","content":"The Feral Hearters and Honorable Accorders didn't leave the Sabbat in my universe, so them being betrayed wouldn't work. At least not in addition to the general betrayal of the Sabbat as a whole. The Camarilla are the enemies of anyone not on Humanity, so the Feral Hearters and Honorable Accordists view leaving the Sabbat as suicide. Thus, the question was always between enduring the Cathari, or purging them via Civil War. Leaving the Sabbat was never viewed as a sane option. The Lasombra defection was much smaller in my universe, and done exclusively by Lasombra who were on Humanity.<br /> <br /> The rejecting the Caledonian faith thing would only resonant with Path of Caine types. It might be used by the player characters as a way to get the Noddists to side with the Grand Inquisitor in the Civil War, but wouldn't work as general reason for the purge, as pretty much all non-Noddists aren't fully onboard with that anyway.<br /> <br /> The rest is useful, however, especially the demiurge idea. Having the Grand Inquisitor frame the demiurge worship as demon worship will work very well mixed in with the broad sectwide resentment felt against the Cathari.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}